{"id": "x6hakzb", "title": "Huge Gap Opens In Kenya's Rift Valley", "description": "Some signs that a break up is coming aren't always clear cut, but when a rift opens up, it's hard to ignore. This is metaphorically true with relationships, and it's literally true with tectonic plates. In late March, a combination of heavy rain and seismic activity resulted in a huge tear in Kenya's Rift Valley. The tear, 50 feet deep and 50 feet wide, tore apart the busy Mai Mahiu-Narok road, and split farms and houses apart, according to Face2Face Africa.", "thumbnails": [{"height": 60, "id": "60", "url": "https://s1.dmcdn.net/v/NMn6t1e1kMU1rrZUY/x60"}, {"height": 120, "id": "120", "url": "https://s2.dmcdn.net/v/NMn6t1e1kMUImqlB1/x120"}, {"height": 180, "id": "180", "url": "https://s2.dmcdn.net/v/NMn6t1e1kMUc01U6x/x180"}, {"height": 240, "id": "240", "url": "https://s1.dmcdn.net/v/NMn6t1e1kMUhKGIae/x240"}, {"height": 360, "id": "360", "url": "https://s1.dmcdn.net/v/NMn6t1e1kMUAHnNtP/x360"}, {"height": 480, "id": "480", "url": "https://s1.dmcdn.net/v/NMn6t1e1kMUGTiwT0/x480"}, {"height": 720, "id": "720", "url": "https://s2.dmcdn.net/v/NMn6t1e1kMU5NnT6f/x720"}, {"height": 1080, "id": "1080", "url": "https://s1.dmcdn.net/v/NMn6t1e1kMU3oTlkY/x1080"}], "duration": 57, "timestamp": 1522818863, "uploader": "Entertainment (now)", "uploader_id": "x22dgie", "age_limit": 0, "tags": [], "view_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "formats": [{"format_id": "hls-380", "url": "https://vod3.cf.dmcdn.net/sec2(sBKaDDGXrA4CPZPbED9idZuKhUkoAVJtOyRWiHBO37UN0BN2cofN1fMWfPL9OE9GH2bT7VH0KAk93pvXoAlA2oOOvE55Sxuykg0nkpbTC3E-KFknDdWetbM2ftZ9GFVUlgaVp_wEqfGhVvVE7EMhz66iTDKNpvLHYdtJM3bscQE)/video/972/448/391844279_mp4_h264_aac_2.m3u8", "manifest_url": "https://cdndirector.dailymotion.com/cdn/manifest/video/x6hakzb.m3u8?sec=YxRcuy0Rtmgr9pGf_FMbXevP2mhkR1ibGqKp54XnnqeBxr7HZInQJZ2iqwcX1tOoVU8kqZaKG1d7DLZr41ZU3w&dmTs=885490&dmV1st=AE8DB4A5098775AD2AE96EFA2353BA1F", "tbr": 460.56, "ext": "mp4", "protocol": "m3u8_native", "